### Mixed tool + RAG
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Según mis documentos y datos del sistema, ¿qué debo revisar antes de la próxima reserva?",
  "topK": 10,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.30
}

### RAG not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "¿Qué dice el documento sobre una regla que no existe?",
  "topK": 10,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.30
}

### Raw RAG search: exact phrase, low threshold
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "visitantes",
  "topK": 20,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.10
}

### Raw RAG search: trash rules, low threshold
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "basura reglas",
  "topK": 20,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.10
}

### Document metadata: RAG index status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "¿Cómo está el índice RAG de mis documentos?",
  "topK": 10,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.30
}

### AI chat history: exclude current session from previous history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatSessionId": "{{chatSessionId}}",
  "question": "Muéstrame mis últimas conversaciones con la IA",
  "topK": 10,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.30
}
